  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Using equipartition of energy, the specific heat (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi>kg</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> ) of Aluminium at high temperature can be estimated to be (atomic weight of Aluminium <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></math>)</p>"
